id: innate-weaponry-first-effect
name: Innate Weaponry
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 2/round
fromTrait: innate-weaponry
fromEffect: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Innate Weaponry's first effect, as a Maneuver: a Weapon of Craftsmanship Grade 4, made on the Gear tab.
text: >
  (1)-[2/Round]: As a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 Action, create a Weapon with a Craftsmanship Grade of 4.

---

# Which Category, asked; the Weapon made on the Gear tab - Grade 4, its Qualities the player's on its sheet - gone with the Trait
# (chat.mjs innateWeapon).
[on used]
innateWeapon();
